Valkey JSON 1.1 release notes
========================

Upgrade urgency levels:

| Level    | Meaning                                                             |
|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| LOW      | No need to upgrade unless there are new features you want to use.   |
| MODERATE | Program an upgrade of the server, but it's not urgent.              |
| HIGH     | There is a critical bug that may affect a subset of users. Upgrade! |
| CRITICAL | There is a critical bug affecting MOST USERS. Upgrade ASAP.         |
| SECURITY | There are security fixes in the release.                            |

================================================================================
Valkey JSON 1.1.0  -  Released Fri 13 November 2026
================================================================================

Upgrade urgency MODERATE: This release adds the `JSON.MERGE` command and fixes
several JSONPath bugs.

New features
============
* Add the `JSON.MERGE` command, which merges a JSON value into an existing document following RFC 7396 (JSON Merge Patch) semantics by @patrickn2 (#95)

Bug fixes
=========
* Fix overflow in JSONPath array slice iteration by @roshkhatri (#124)
* Fix JSONPath filter expressions evaluated over object children by @mohanrajendran (#123)
* Apply JSONPath wildcard and filter segments sequentially by @mohanrajendran (#126)
